menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_WEARABLE_LOCATION
    bool "Enable wearable location, geofence and SOS"
    default n
    help
        Runs the bounded wearable location policy, evaluates a geofence and
        latches an SOS until it is cancelled. The default policy keeps sampling
        off and requires a guardian permission, so a body without a wearable
        sensor simply does not link the component.

endmenu
